target: internal/report/post.go
verify: go test ./internal/report/ -count=1 -run 'TestOnlyALabelOnThePRIsRemovedOrWarnedAbout'
expect: --- FAIL: TestOnlyALabelOnThePRIsRemovedOrWarnedAbout/a_carried_label_in_another_case
why:    GitHub label names are case-insensitive, so a PR carrying Risk:Low carries risk:low; read case-sensitively, it reads as absent, its removal is skipped, and the stale level stands beside the new one with nothing said
--- old
		on[strings.ToLower(l.Name)] = true
--- new
		on[l.Name] = true
